@baseUrl = http://localhost:5217/api/v1

### 1. Login to get token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/guest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "test-matches-device"
}

### 2. Get my match history (should be empty initially)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/match-history?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### 3. Get my match history page 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/match-history?page=2&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### 4. Get another user's match history (replace with actual user ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/match-history?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### 5. Get match detail (replace with actual match ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### 6. Get match history without auth (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/match-history

### 7. Get invalid user's match history (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/match-history
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### 8. Get invalid match detail (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}
